@{
	Layout = "~/Views/Instruction/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="instruction-content">
	<ul>
        <li>Upline Setting: the %Min Dowline and %Max Downline set by direct upline agent.</li>
        <li>% Preset: the share amount taken by the upper agent, particularly on the <b>Soccer Deadball Handicap</b> bet type. If % Preset is X%, then share amount taken on all members of its line must be &lt;= X.</li>
		<li>% Max Downline: the share amount which will be given to an agent.</li>
        <li>% Min Downline: the minimum share amount which an agent and its down-line agents must cover.</li>
	    <li>[x - y]: input range. If K is the entered amount, then K must be: x &lt;= K &lt;= y.</li>
    </ul>
	<p>
		<span class="note">Note:</span> only allow two numbers after the decimal point. For instance, 10.25 is a valid input, but 10.555 is not.
	</p>
</div>